#multi threading is a process of executing multiple threads simultaneously
-Thread -> is light weight sub process,the smallest unit of processing
-any process contains atleast one thread which called main thread

#Creating Threads in java(2 ways)
1.Using Runnable Interface 2.Using Thread class
-Thread class implements Runnable Interface
-when we create thread by using Runnable interface then we need to create 
 Thread Class object and need to provide our thread object to it,because Runnable Interface dose not Have start()
-advantage of using Runnable interface is we can extend another class also
-When we create thread using Thread Class then we need to write run() method manually
 
